Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: mptcp-bpf-blest
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libbpf0 | libbpf1
Description: MPTCP BPF BLEST Scheduler
 BPF implementation of the BLEST (Blocking Estimation) MPTCP scheduler.
 It sends on the lowest-RTT subflow while its congestion window has
 room, and when it has none, uses a slower subflow only if what that
 subflow holds in the MPTCP send window would not block the fastest
 one.
 .
 The compiled BPF object is installed into /usr/share/bpf/scheduler/
 and can be loaded with mptcpd or iproute2.
